      "blurb": "Ancient krogan veteran and clan counselor",
      "publicNotes": "<p>Krogan elders have survived centuries of warfare, genophage, and political upheaval. They no longer seek out battle - there is little glory in fighting the young - but they remain formidable. Their counsel carries enormous weight in krogan society, and their headbutts still break bones. Killing a krogan elder is an unforgivable insult to their bloodline.</p><p><strong>Krogan Resilience:</strong> The elder regains 10 HP at the start of each of their turns (fast healing 10), unless they are on the verge of death.</p>",
